        "text": "ATT&CK release: 17.1\nTechnique: Valid Accounts (T1078)\nMitigation: Privileged Account Management (M1026)",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 104,
        "source_kind": "attack"
      },
      {
        "citation_id": "E13",
        "doc_id": "attack:17.1:relationship--89887815-acfc-42f9-9172-81437cf9ff69",
